helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C3				0	ast	Enables you to edit points on your drawing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C8				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10030200.xhp\" name=\"Glue points\"\>Glue Points\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D7				0	ast	Enables you to edit glue points on your drawing.				20200411 15:09:53
