helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0214.xhp	0	help	par_id3150085				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>When creating or editing an SQL query, use the icons in the \<emph\>Query Design\</emph\> Bar to control the display of data.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0214.xhp	0	help	par_id3150276				0	ast	Depending on whether you have created the query or view in the \<emph\>Design\</emph\> or \<emph\>SQL\</emph\> tab page, the following icons appear:				20200411 15:09:53
