helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	ast	The following logical operators are supported by $[officename] Basic.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	ast	Logical operators combine (bitwise) the contents of two expressions or variables, for example, to test if specific bits are set or not.				20200411 15:09:53
