helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154253				0	ast	Click \<emph\>Append\</emph\> and select an external library to append.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154705				0	ast	Select all libraries to be appended in the \<emph\>Append Libraries\</emph\> dialog. The dialog displays all libraries that are contained in the selected file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3163807				0	ast	If you want to insert the library as a reference only check the \<emph\>Insert as reference (read-only)\</emph\> box. Read-only libraries are fully functional but cannot be modified in the Basic IDE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145228				0	ast	Check the \<emph\>Replace existing libraries\</emph\> box if you want existing libraries of the same name to be overwritten.				20200411 15:09:53
