helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3153727	8			0	ast	\<emph\>Text\</emph\>: String expression displayed as a message in the dialog box. Line breaks can be inserted with Chr$(13).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3147317	9			0	ast	\<emph\>DialogTitle\</emph\>: String expression displayed in the title bar of the dialog. If omitted, the name of the respective application is displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3153954	10			0	ast	\<emph\>Type\</emph\>: Any integer expression that specifies the dialog type and defines the number and type of buttons or icons displayed. \<emph\>Type\</emph\> represents a combination of bit patterns (dialog elements defined by adding the respective values):				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319	11			0	ast	\<emph\>Values\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3147397				0	ast	0 : Display OK button only.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3145646				0	ast	1 : Display OK and Cancel buttons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3149410				0	ast	2 : Display Abort, Retry, and Ignore buttons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3151075				0	ast	3 : Display Yes, No, and Cancel buttons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3153878				0	ast	4 : Display Yes and No buttons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3155601				0	ast	5 : Display Retry and Cancel buttons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150716				0	ast	16 : Add the Stop icon to the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3153837				0	ast	32 : Add the Question icon to the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150751				0	ast	48 : Add the Exclamation Point icon to the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3146915				0	ast	64 : Add the Information icon to the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3145640				0	ast	128 : First button in the dialog as default button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3153765				0	ast	256 : Second button in the dialog as default button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3153715				0	ast	512 : Third button in the dialog as default button.				20200411 15:09:53
