helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080601.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159201				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03080601.xhp\" name=\"Abs Function [Runtime]\"\>Abs Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
