helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	ast	Tests if a Basic Uno object supports certain Uno interfaces.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154232				0	ast	Returns True, if \<emph\>all\</emph\> stated Uno interfaces are supported, otherwise False is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
