helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	ast	HasUnoInterfaces( oTest, Uno-Interface-Name 1 [, Uno-Interface-Name 2, ...])				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345				0	ast	Return value:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148538				0	ast	Bool				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159157				0	ast	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	ast	\<emph\>oTest:\</emph\> the Basic Uno object that you want to test.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03104400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149236				0	ast	\<emph\>Uno-Interface-Name:\</emph\> list of Uno interface names.				20200411 15:09:53
