helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010303.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148947				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03010303.xhp\" name=\"Red Function [Runtime]\"\>Red Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010303.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	ast	Returns the Red component of the specified color code.				20200411 15:09:53
