helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	ast	Returns the minute of the hour that corresponds to the serial time value that is generated by the TimeSerial or the TimeValue function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154758				0	ast	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	ast	Minute (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
