helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	ast	\<emph\>Color value\</emph\>: Long integer expression that specifies any \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000003.xhp#farbcodes\" name=\"color code\"\>color code\</link\> for which to return the blue component.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153091				0	ast	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
