helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3143228				0	ast	statement block				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235				0	ast	Loop [{While | Until} condition = True]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024				0	ast	Parameters/Elements				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	ast	\<emph\>Condition:\</emph\> A comparison, numeric or string expression, that evaluates either True or False.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	ast	\<emph\>Statement block:\</emph\> Statements that you want to repeat while or until the condition is True.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	ast	The \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\> statement executes a loop as long as, or until, a certain condition is True. The condition for exiting the loop must be entered following either the \<emph\>Do\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Loop\</emph\> statement. The following examples are valid combinations:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154366				0	ast	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	ast	Do While condition = True				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149203				0	ast	...statement block				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	ast	Loop				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154124				0	ast	The statement block between the Do While and the Loop statements is repeated so long as the condition is true.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968				0	ast	Do Until condition = True				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909				0	ast	...statement block				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159151				0	ast	Loop				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150440				0	ast	The statement block between the Do Until and the Loop statements is repeated if the condition so long as the condition is false.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153952				0	ast	Do				20200411 15:09:53
