helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020204.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	ast	\<emph\>FileNumber:\</emph\> Any integer expression that defines the file that you want to write to.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020204.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	8			0	ast	\<emph\>Position: \</emph\>For relative files (random access files), the number of the record that you want to write.				20200411 15:09:53
