helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150682				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03131900.xhp\" name=\"GlobalScope [Runtime]\"\>GlobalScope [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	ast	Basic source code and dialogs are organized in a library system.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315				0	ast	The LibraryContainer contains libraries				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	ast	Libraries can contain modules and dialogs				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143271				0	ast	In Basic:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3153061				0	ast	The LibraryContainer is called \<emph\>BasicLibraries\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154346				0	ast	In dialogs:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	ast	The LibraryContainer is called \<emph\>DialogLibraries\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	ast	Both LibraryContainers exist in an application level and within every document. In the document Basic, the document's LibraryContainers are called automatically. If you want to call the global LibraryContainers from within a document, you must use the keyword \<emph\>GlobalScope\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148920				0	ast	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3149203				0	ast	GlobalScope				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154685				0	ast	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154124				0	ast	Example in the document Basic				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131900.xhp	0	help	par_id3158408				0	ast	' calling Dialog1 in the document library Standard				20200411 15:09:53
