helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020408.xhp	0	help	par_id3153193				0	ast	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that contains an unambiguous file specification. You can also use \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp\" name=\"URL notation\"\>URL notation\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020408.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	ast	This function determines the length of a file. If the FileLen function is called for an open file, it returns the file length before it was opened. To determine the current file length of an open file, use the Lof function.				20200411 15:09:53
