helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150986				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>Or operator (logical)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150986				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03060500.xhp\" name=\"Or-Operator [Runtime]\"\>Or Operator [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	ast	Performs a logical OR disjunction on two expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148664				0	ast	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	ast	Result = Expression1 Or Expression2				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151211				0	ast	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	ast	\<emph\>Result:\</emph\> Any numeric variable that contains the result of the disjunction.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147229				0	ast	\<emph\>Expression1, Expression2:\</emph\> Any numeric expressions that you want to compare.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	ast	A logical OR disjunction of two Boolean expressions returns the value True if at least one comparison expression is True.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	ast	A bit-wise comparison sets a bit in the result if the corresponding bit is set in at least one of the two expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3161831				0	ast	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427				0	ast	Sub ExampleOr				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	ast	Dim vA as Variant, vB as Variant, vC as Variant, vD as Variant				20200411 15:09:53
