helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147348				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01040000.xhp\" name=\"Event-Driven Macros\"\>Event-Driven Macros\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	ast	This section describes how to assign Basic programs to program events.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149263				0	ast	You can automatically execute a macro when a specified software event occurs by assigning the desired macro to the event. The following table provides an overview of program events and at what point an assigned macro is executed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	ast	Event				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799				0	ast	An assigned macro is executed...				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379				0	ast	Program Start				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	ast	... after a $[officename] application is started.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146914				0	ast	Program End				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153765				0	ast	...before a $[officename] application is terminated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145150				0	ast	Create Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163808				0	ast	...after a new document is created with \<emph\>File - New\</emph\> or with the \<emph\>New\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790				0	ast	Open Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154572				0	ast	...after a document is opened with \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\> or with the \<emph\>Open\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153266				0	ast	Save Document As				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150208				0	ast	...before a document is saved under a specified name (with \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>, or with \<emph\>File - Save\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon, if a document name has not yet been specified).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158215				0	ast	Document has been saved as				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150980				0	ast	... after a document was saved under a specified name (with \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>, or with \<emph\>File - Save\</emph\> or with the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon, if a document name has not yet been specified).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519				0	ast	Save Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155529				0	ast	...before a document is saved with \<emph\>File - Save\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon, provided that a document name has already been specified.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149404				0	ast	Document has been saved				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151332				0	ast	...after a document is saved with \<emph\>File - Save\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> icon, provided that a document name has already been specified.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159171				0	ast	Document is closing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146868				0	ast	...before a document is closed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159097				0	ast	Document closed				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148606				0	ast	...after a document was closed. Note that the "Save Document" event may also occur when the document is saved before closing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144772				0	ast	Activate Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149442				0	ast	...after a document is brought to the foreground.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150888				0	ast	Deactivate Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154060				0	ast	...after another document is brought to the foreground.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152384				0	ast	Print Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152873				0	ast	...after the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog is closed, but before the actual print process begins.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159227				0	ast	JavaScript run-time error				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145362				0	ast	...when a JavaScript run-time error occurs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154767				0	ast	Print Mail Merge				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153555				0	ast	...after the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog is closed, but before the actual print process begins. This event occurs for each copy printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156366				0	ast	Change of the page count				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154627				0	ast	...when the page count changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154737				0	ast	Message received				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150952				0	ast	...if a message was received.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153299				0	ast	Assigning a Macro to an Event				20200411 15:09:53
