helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146098				0	ast	Select whether you want the assignment to be globally valid or just valid in the current document in the \<emph\>Save In\</emph\> listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150431				0	ast	Select the event from the \<emph\>Event\</emph\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148742				0	ast	Click \<emph\>Macro\</emph\> and select the macro to be assigned to the selected event.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146321				0	ast	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to assign the macro.				20200411 15:09:53
