helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146883				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Events\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155909				0	ast	Select whether you want to remove a global assignment or an assignment that is just valid in the current document by selecting the option in the \<emph\>Save In\</emph\> listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
