helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Not-Operator [Runtime]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156024				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>Not operator (logical)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03060400.xhp\" name=\"Not-Operator [Runtime]\"\>Not-Operator [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414				0	ast	Negates an expression by inverting the bit values.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149457				0	ast	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150360				0	ast	Result = Not Expression				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151211				0	ast	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228				0	ast	\<emph\>Result:\</emph\> Any numeric variable that contains the result of the negation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154124				0	ast	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Any expression that you want to negate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	ast	When a Boolean expression is negated, the value True changes to False, and the value False changes to True.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145785				0	ast	In a bitwise negation each individual bit is inverted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153093				0	ast	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153143				0	ast	Sub ExampleNot				20200411 15:09:53
