helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	ast	\<emph\>n:\</emph\> Numeric expression that specifies the number of characters that you want to return. If \<emph\>n\</emph\> = 0, a zero-length string is returned. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	ast	The following example converts a date in YYYY.MM.DD format to MM/DD/YYYY format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	hd_id3125863				0	ast	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3144761				0	ast	Sub ExampleUSDate				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194				0	ast	Dim sInput As String				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3154217				0	ast	Dim sUS_date As String				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	ast	sInput = InputBox("Please input a date in the international format 'YYYY-MM-DD'")				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3149203				0	ast	sUS_date = Mid(sInput, 6, 2)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	ast	sUS_date = sUS_date & "/"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3153770				0	ast	sUS_date = sUS_date & Right(sInput, 2)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3161833				0	ast	sUS_date = sUS_date & "/"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3147215				0	ast	sUS_date = sUS_date & Left(sInput, 4)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666				0	ast	MsgBox sUS_date				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3153138				0	ast	End Sub				20200411 15:09:53
