helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	ast	Return				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154321				0	ast	End Sub/Function				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3147318				0	ast	The \<emph\>GoSub\</emph\> statement calls a local subroutine indicated by a label from within a subroutine or a function. The name of the label must end with a colon (":").				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153190				0	ast	If the program encounters a Return statement not preceded by \<emph\>GoSub\</emph\>, $[officename] Basic returns an error message. Use \<emph\>Exit Sub\</emph\> or \<emph\>Exit Function\</emph\> to ensure that the program leaves a Sub or Function before reaching the next Return statement.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799				0	ast	The following example demonstrates the use of \<emph\>GoSub\</emph\> and \<emph\>Return\</emph\>. By executing a program section twice, the program calculates the square root of two numbers that are entered by the user.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156284				0	ast	Example:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073				0	ast	Sub ExampleGoSub				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154097				0	ast	dim iInputa as Single				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	ast	dim iInputb as Single				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	ast	dim iInputc as Single				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3146970				0	ast	iInputa = Int(InputBox$ ("Enter the first number: ","NumberInput"))				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150329				0	ast	iInputb = Int(InputBox$ ("Enter the second number: ","NumberInput"))				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3156277				0	ast	iInputc=iInputa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3150321				0	ast	GoSub SquareRoot				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3154756				0	ast	Print "The square root of";iInputa;" is";iInputc				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764				0	ast	iInputc=iInputb				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960				0	ast	GoSub SquareRoot				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340				0	ast	Print "The square root of";iInputb;" is";iInputc				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3166450				0	ast	Exit Sub				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3155176				0	ast	SquareRoot:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257				0	ast	iInputc=sqr(iInputc)				20200411 15:09:53
