helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153361				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020407.xhp\" name=\"FileDateTime Function [Runtime]\"\>FileDateTime Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423				0	ast	Returns a string that contains the date and the time that a file was created or last modified.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154685				0	ast	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	par_id3154124				0	ast	FileDateTime (Text As String)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150448				0	ast	Parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	par_id3159153				0	ast	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that contains an unambiguous (no wildcards) file specification. You can also use \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp\" name=\"URL notation\"\>URL notation\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020407.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306				0	ast	This function determines the exact time of creation or last modification of a file, returned in the format "MM.DD.YYYY HH.MM.SS".				20200411 15:09:53
