helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3153764				0	ast	REM LinSearch searches a TextArray:sList() for a TextEntry:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3148995				0	ast	REM Returns the index of the entry or 0 ( Null)				20200411 15:09:53
