helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	ast	Reads a record from a relative file, or a sequence of bytes from a binary file, into a variable.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154346				0	ast	See also: \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020204.xhp\" name=\"PUT\"\>\<item type=\"literal\"\>PUT\</item\>\</link\> Statement				20200411 15:09:53
