helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145211				0	ast	Decrease Spacing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	ast	You can make additional adjustments to the spacing by selecting \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\" name=\"Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\"\>\<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</emph\>\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
