helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149893	5			0	ast	The\<emph\> Run Query \</emph\>function allows you to check the query. When you save the query, it is stored in the \<emph\>Query\</emph\> tab page.				20200411 15:09:53
