helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150445				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PreviousPage\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves back to the previous page in the document.\</ahelp\> This function is only active when you select the \<emph\>Page Preview\</emph\> function on the \<emph\>File\</emph\> menu.				20200411 15:09:53
