helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN10595				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Fontwork Gallery displays previews of Fontwork objects. To insert an object into your document, select the object, and then click OK.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
