helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149495				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormFiltered\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Switches between the filtered and unfiltered view of the table.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
