helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155101				0	ast	Form				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149167				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_NEWDOCUMENT:LB_FORM\"\>Specifies whether the hyperlink is inserted as text or as a button.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
