helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144760				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_NEWDOCUMENT:BTN_SCRIPT\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Assign Macro\</emph\> dialog, in which you can give events such as "mouse over object" or "trigger hyperlink" their own program codes.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
