helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\basicshapes.xhp	0	help	par_idN10567				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Basic Shapes toolbar which you can use to insert graphics into your document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\basicshapes.xhp	0	help	par_idN10591				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click an icon on the Basic Shapes toolbar, and then drag in the document to draw the shape.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\basicshapes.xhp	0	help	par_idN10594				0	ast	Some shapes have a handle which you can drag to change the properties of the shape. The mouse pointer changes to a hand symbol over these special handles.				20200411 15:09:53
