helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155351				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:StyleApply\"\>Assigns a style to the current paragraph, selected paragraphs, or to a selected object.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10621				0	ast	To reset the selected objects to the default paragraph style, select Clear formatting. Select More to open the Styles and Formatting window.				20200411 15:09:53
