helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170802.xhp	0	help	par_id3150476				0	ast	Specifies which fields in the table control field should be displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170802.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149346				0	ast	Selected Fields				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170802.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_LISTBOX_RID_PAGE_GW_FIELDSELECTION_LB_SELECTED_FIELDS\"\>Displays the data fields that are accepted into the form field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
