helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152895				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/10100000.xhp\" name=\"Close Window\"\>Close Window\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CloseWin\"\>Closes the current window.\</ahelp\> Choose \<emph\>Window - Close Window\</emph\>, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F4. In the page preview of $[officename] Writer and Calc, you can close the current window by clicking the \<emph\>Close Preview\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143				0	ast	If additional views of the current document were opened by \<emph\>Window - New Window\</emph\>, this command will close only the current view.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01050000.xhp\" name=\"Close the current document\"\>Close the current document\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Internet URLs				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154094				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/09020000.xhp\" name=\"Internet URLs\"\>Internet URLs\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_URL\"\>Allows you to either type a URL, or insert a URL from a document using drag-and-drop.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153894				0	ast	You can edit the URL and insert it at the current cursor position in the active document with the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> icon. The \<emph\>Link\</emph\> icon can only be activated if the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> field contains text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Insert Mode				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149748				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/20040000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Mode\"\>Insert Mode\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363	2			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertMode\"\>Displays the current insert mode. You can toggle between INSRT = insert and OVER = overwrite.\</ahelp\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>This field is only active if the cursor is in the input line of the formula bar or in a cell. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154422				0	ast	Click in the field to toggle the modes (except in the $[officename] Basic IDE, where only the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> mode is active). If the cursor is positioned in a text document, you may also use the Insert key (if available on your keyboard) to toggle the modes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	ast	\<emph\>Mode\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155391				0	ast	\<emph\>Result\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149388				0	ast	INSRT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147243				0	ast	In the insert mode, new text is inserted at the cursor position and the following text is shifted to the right. The cursor is displayed as a vertical line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148539				0	ast	OVER				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156327				0	ast	In the overwrite mode, any existing text is replaced by new text. The cursor is displayed as a thick vertical line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14020200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Switch Design View On / Off				20200411 15:09:53
