helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149495				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Stop\"\>Click to interrupt the current loading process, Ctrl-click (Mac: Command-click) to interrupt all loading processes.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
