helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153698				0	ast	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The indents of two paragraphs are moved with the \<emph\>Increase Indent\</emph\> function to a standard tab distance of 2 cm:\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
