helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153126				0	ast	Indent increased by the amount with the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command key\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl key\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
