helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>First select some text or an object, then click this icon. Then click on or drag across other text or click an object to apply the same formatting.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	ast	Click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3610034\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatpaintbrush.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3610034\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> toolbar. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10639				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id5406964\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatpaintbrush.png\" width=\"0.423cm\" height=\"0.423cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5406964\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
