helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3149767				0	ast	If you selected one of the date formats (DMY), (MDY), or (YMD) and you enter numbers without date delimiters, the numbers are interpreted as follows:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3150650	76			0	ast	Number of characters 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3150495				0	ast	Date format				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212				0	ast	6				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153056				0	ast	Two characters each are taken for day, month, and year in the selected order.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3147352				0	ast	8				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	ast	Four characters are taken for the year, two each for month and day, in the selected order.				20200411 15:09:53
