helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MN_READONLY_PLUGINOFF\"\>Disables inserted plug-ins.\</ahelp\> Click this command again to reactivate the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#plugin\" name=\"plug-ins\"\>plug-ins\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
