helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145791				0	ast	Moves the selected control in steps of 1 mm in the respective direction. In point edit mode, it changes the size of the selected control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154665				0	ast	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab				20200411 15:09:53
