helpcontent2	source\text\shared\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150208				0	ast	Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab				20200411 15:09:53
