helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145162				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_OPTIONBUTTON1\"\>All cells with the selected Cell Styles are converted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152974				0	ast	Currency cells in the current sheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154479				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_OPTIONBUTTON2\"\>All currency cells in the active spreadsheet will be converted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
