helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146912				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_OPTIONBUTTON3\"\>All currency cells in the active document will be converted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155444				0	ast	Selected range				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153736				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLGCONVERT_OPTIONBUTTON4\"\>All currency cells in the range selected before the converter was called will be converted.\</ahelp\> All cells must have the same format so that they can be recognized as a selected range.				20200411 15:09:53
