helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150775				0	ast	The wizard converts binary documents and templates from older versions, as well as documents from Microsoft Word, Excel and PowerPoint. The source files are only read, not edited. New target files are written with the new file name extension in the same or a new folder.				20200411 15:09:53
