helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159224				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01050000.xhp\" name=\"Presentation Wizard\"\>Presentation Wizard\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	ast	\<variable id=\"autopilot\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_AUTOPILOT\"\>Use the wizard to interactively create a presentation. With the wizard, you can modify the sample templates to suit your needs.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The wizard takes you step by step through the design elements and offers various editing options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154289				0	ast	The Presentation Wizard starts automatically when you open a new presentation. You can deactivate this function if you choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070500.xhp\" name=\"Presentation - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress - General\</link\>\</emph\> and deselect the \<emph\>Start with Wizard\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	ast	Within each wizard page, you can undo, modify, or skip altogether the editing steps. If you decide to skip over one of the pages, the wizard uses the default settings.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159269	4			0	ast	<< Back				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_ASS:BUT_LAST\"\>Returns to the previous step without deleting your current settings.\</ahelp\> You can only select this button after the second editing step.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153349	6			0	ast	Next >>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156307				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_ASS:BUT_NEXT\"\>Accepts the new settings and moves to the next page.\</ahelp\> You will not be able to select this button in the last editing step.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156327				0	ast	Create				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	ast	The wizard creates a new document based on the specified settings. You can later specify a name for the document and save it.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	ast	$[officename] saves the current wizard settings and uses them as default the next time you open the wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
