helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id0001				0	ast	  \<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_HID_SIDEBAR_WINDOW\"\>The sidebar provides frequently used tools, grouped in decks. Click on a tab in the vertical tab bar to choose a deck.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	hd_id0200				0	ast	Tab Bar				20200411 15:09:53
