helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\export_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3150084				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>File - Save as\</emph\>. You will see the \<emph\>Save as\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\export_ms.xhp	0	help	par_id3153348				0	ast	In the \<emph\>Save as type\</emph\> or \<emph\>File type\</emph\> list box, select the desired format.				20200411 15:09:53
