helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148874				0	ast	More information is found in the \<emph\>$[officename] Developer's Guide\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3149964				0	ast	-env				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id2439039				0	ast	Sets another environment for the program start.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id2789086				0	ast	Use soffice -env:UserInstallation=$(URL) where $(URL) is the URL of a folder that contains the "user" folder.				20200411 15:09:53
