helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3163666				0	ast	Prints the files \<emph\>{filename1} {filename2} ...\</emph\> to the default printer and ends. The splash screen does not appear.				20200411 15:09:53
