helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator_setcursor.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150774				0	ast	\<variable id=\"navigator_setcursor\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/navigator_setcursor.xhp\" name=\"Navigation to Quickly Reach Objects\"\>Navigation to Quickly Reach Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
