helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AA				0	ast	Insert a form control, for example a button: Open the Form Controls toolbar, click the \<emph\>Push Button\</emph\> icon, drag open a button on your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B59				0	ast	With the form control selected, click \<emph\>Control\</emph\> on the Form Controls toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
