helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	ast	For the current paragraph or selected paragraphs you can switch off the automatic numbering or listing. Click the \<emph\>Numbering Off\</emph\> icon in the \<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\> bar.				20200411 15:09:53
