helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149441				0	ast	Press Shift+F1 to display the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0108.xhp\" name=\"Extended Tips\"\>Extended Tips\</link\> for the currently selected command, icon or control.				20200411 15:09:53
