helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	ast	Select a theme.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148617				0	ast	Select an object by a single click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147443				0	ast	Drag the object on to the other object in the document while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Editing Chart Axes				20200411 15:09:53
