helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	ast	To edit the axes of a chart that you have inserted:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	ast	Double-click on the chart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3147242				0	ast	A gray border appears around the chart and the menu bar now contains commands for editing the objects in the chart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Format - Axis\</emph\>, then select the axis (or axes) that you would like to edit. A dialog appears.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	ast	Select from the available sections and make the required changes (for example, select the \<emph\>Scale\</emph\> tab if you want to modify the scale of the axis).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_axis.xhp	0	help	par_id3156327				0	ast	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. In your document, click outside the chart to exit chart editing mode.				20200411 15:09:53
