helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A3				0	ast	\<variable id=\"data_new\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_new.xhp\"\>Creating a New Database\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_new.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C4				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>File - New - Database\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
