helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Searching for Attributes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	bm_id5681020				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>fonts;finding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>font attributes;finding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text attributes;finding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>attributes; finding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>finding; attributes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>resetting;Find & Replace mode\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	ast	\<variable id=\"find_attributes\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/find_attributes.xhp\"\>Searching for Attributes\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN10681				0	ast	You can search for text with attributes that are applied either by direct formatting or by styles. For example, if you search for the \<emph\>Font\</emph\> attribute, all instances of text that do not use the default font are found. All text that has a directly coded font attribute, and all text where a style switches the font attribute, are found.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN10688				0	ast	If you want to find text with any font by name, click the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> button in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100000.xhp\"\>Find & Replace\</link\> dialog of %PRODUCTNAME Writer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069D				0	ast	After you select the attributes that you want to search for, the \<emph\>Search for Styles\</emph\> box in the \<emph\>Options \</emph\>area of the %PRODUCTNAME Writer \<emph\>Find & Replace \</emph\>dialog changes to \<emph\>Including Styles\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B0				0	ast	If you want to search for text in which attributes were set by using direct formatting and styles, select the \<emph\>Including Styles\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B7				0	ast	The search criteria for attributes are listed below the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BE				0	ast	To search for all font changes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C5				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Find & Replace\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	ast	Clear the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> text box if necessary.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	ast	Click \<emph\>Attributes\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	ast	In the \<emph\>Attributes\</emph\> dialog, select the \<emph\>Font\</emph\> check box, and click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E8				0	ast	In the \<emph\>Find & Replace\</emph\> dialog, you now can read "Font" below the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> text box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F4				0	ast	Click \<emph\>Find\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FB				0	ast	All places where a font change was applied, either directly or by assigning an appropriate style, are found.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FE				0	ast	To reset the Find & Replace mode				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN10702				0	ast	To stop searching for the current attributes, reset the \<emph\>Find & Replace\</emph\> dialog to normal mode.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070C				0	ast	Click \<emph\>No Format\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071E				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100000.xhp\"\>Find & Replace\</link\> dialog				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_id6837672				0	ast	Searching for attributes is available in the Find & Replace dialog for text documents.				20200411 15:09:53
