helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"svx:Edit:RID_SVXDLG_JAVA_PARAMETER:ED_PARAMETER\"\>Enter a start parameter for a JRE as you would on a command line. Click Assign to add the parameter to the list of available start parameters.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_id5404522				0	ast	Do not use escape characters or quotes in path names.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D8				0	ast	For example, to point the system property "myprop" to a folder, enter the following parameter:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DD				0	ast	-Dmyprop=c:\\program files\\java				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057B				0	ast	To enable debugging in a JRE, enter the following parameters:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\javaparameters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057E				0	ast	-Xdebug				20200411 15:09:53
