helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155306				0	ast	If \<emph\>Number recognition\</emph\> is not marked, numbers are saved in text format and are automatically left-aligned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155856				0	ast	Number format recognition				20200411 15:09:53
