helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153876				0	ast	Alignment				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTTABLE_PAGE_CB_NUMALIGNMENT\"\>Specifies that numbers are always bottom right aligned in the cell.\</ahelp\> If this field is not marked numbers are always top left aligned in the cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146792				0	ast	Direct formatting is not influenced by the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> field. If you center align the cell contents directly, they remain centered irrespective of whether text or numbers are involved.				20200411 15:09:53
