helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150358				0	ast	Prefix				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:ED_URL\"\>This text box displays the URL and the first part of the query command for a search machine. A URL can also be typed directly.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153193				0	ast	Suffix				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153970				0	ast	The search terms are passed between the prefix and the suffix.\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:ED_POSTFIX\"\>The suffix provides the command sequence, sent at the end of a search.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147086				0	ast	Separator				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:ED_SEPARATOR\"\>If you type more than one word while running a search, these words will be separated by the character specified here.\</ahelp\> Most search engines require the "+" character.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149560				0	ast	To determine which prefixes, separators and suffixes to use when defining a new search engine:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159255				0	ast	Activate the search engine and perform a search with at least two words.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	ast	Copy the URL from your browser's \<emph\>URL\</emph\> field and paste it into a blank document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148647				0	ast	Change the conditions for the search in the search engine, if it offers you the choice.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147317				0	ast	Again, copy the contents of the \<emph\>URL\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147213				0	ast	Compare the URLs with the sample URLs in the fields of this dialog and make a note of the prefixes, suffixes and separators used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147348				0	ast	Case match				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154918				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:ED_CASE\"\>Determines the case match for running a search.\</ahelp\> The list contains the following entries: \<emph\>None\</emph\>, \<emph\>Upper\</emph\> and \<emph\>Lower\</emph\>. The search terms entered are converted according to your selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	ast	Search engines handle queries differently according to the way they are constructed. For example, some are case sensitive and some are not. Because of this, it is best to select \<emph\>None\</emph\> as the case match option.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156283				0	ast	New				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149413				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:PB_NEW\"\>Use this button to include a new search engine.\</ahelp\>\<emph\>New\</emph\> deletes all important entries of the entry mask such as "Name" and "Suffix". Enter the new search engine together with all of the necessary details. As soon as you accept your entries with \<emph\>Add\</emph\>, the new search engine will appear in the search engine list under \<emph\>Search in\</emph\>. Close the dialog with the \<emph\>OK\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145254				0	ast	Add				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3144767				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:PB_ADD\"\>Click this button to add a new configuration to the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155603				0	ast	Modify				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151320				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:PB_CHANGE\"\>Click this button to apply the modifications made to an existing configuration.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149122				0	ast	Delete				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154270				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:PB_DELETE\"\>Click this button to delete the selected search engine from the list. There will be no security response.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Searching in Japanese				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155338				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01150200.xhp\" name=\"Searching in Japanese\"\>Searching in Japanese\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152996				0	ast	Defines the search options for Japanese.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159399				0	ast	Treat as equal				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_JSEARCH_OPTIONS_CB_MATCH_PROLONGED_SOUNDMARK\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the options to be treated as equal in a search.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148944				0	ast	Ignore				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_JSEARCH_OPTIONS_CB_IGNORE_MIDDLE_DOT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the characters to be ignored.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Asian Layout				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156414				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01150100.xhp\" name=\"Asian Layout\"\>Asian Layout\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	ast	Defines the typographic default settings for Asian text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143268				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>kerning;Asian texts\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143268				0	ast	Kerning				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155535				0	ast	Defines the default settings for kerning between individual characters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147275				0	ast	Western characters only				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_CHAR_KERNING\"\>Specifies that kerning is only applied to western text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148538				0	ast	Western text and Asian punctuation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147336				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_CHAR_PUNCT\"\>Specifies that kerning is applied to both western text and Asian punctuation.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153088				0	ast	Character spacing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	ast	Defines the default settings for character spacing in Asian texts, cells, and drawing objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150669				0	ast	No compression				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_NO_COMP\"\>Specifies that no compression at all will occur.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	ast	Compress only punctuation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_PUNCT_COMP\"\>Specifies that only the punctuation is compressed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151245				0	ast	Compress punctuation and Japanese Kana				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154346				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_PUNCT_KANA_COMP\"\>Specifies that punctuation and Japanese Kana are compressed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148552				0	ast	First and last characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	ast	Defines the default settings for 'first' and 'last' characters. In the dialog that appears when you choose \<emph\>Format -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020700.xhp\" name=\"Asian Typography\"\>\<emph\>Asian Typography\</emph\>\</link\>, you can specify whether the list of forbidden characters applies to those at the beginning or end of a line in a paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154071				0	ast	Language				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_LB_LANGUAGE\"\>Specifies the language for which you want to define first and last characters.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145606				0	ast	Default				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148920	22			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_CB_STANDARD\"\>When you mark\<emph\> Default\</emph\>, the following two text boxes are filled with the default characters for the selected language:\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144761				0	ast	Not at start of line:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156214				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_START\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the beginning of a line.\</ahelp\> If a character typed here is positioned at the beginning of a line after a line break, it is automatically moved to the end of the previous line. For example, an exclamation point at the end of a sentence never appears at the start of a line if it is part of the \<emph\>Not at start of line\</emph\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154908				0	ast	Not at end of line:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153367	26			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_END\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the end of a line.\</ahelp\> If a character typed here is positioned at the end of a line due to a line break, it is automatically moved to the beginning of the next line. For example, a currency symbol that appears in front of an amount never appears at the end of a line if it is part of the\<emph\> Not at end of line\</emph\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	User Data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155805				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>data; user data\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>user data; input\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>personal data input\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155805				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010100.xhp\" name=\"User Data\"\>User Data\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_OPTIONS_GENERAL\"\>Use this tab page to enter or edit user data.\</ahelp\> Some of the data may have already been entered by the user when installing $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748				0	ast	User data is used by templates and Wizards in $[officename]. For example, the "First name" and "Last name" data fields are used to automatically insert your name as the author of a new document. You can see this under \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153031				0	ast	Some of the user data is included automatically in an internal dictionary so that it is recognized by the spellchecker. If typing errors are made, the program can use this data to suggest replacements. Note that changes to data take effect only after $[officename] is restarted.				20200411 15:09:53
