helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3145230				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCEGRADIENTS_COLOR\"\>Specifies that gradients are only printed in a single intermediate color.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
