helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148922				0	ast	In a presentation or drawing document, this function can also be accessed with the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/13160000.xhp\" name=\"Snap to Object Border\"\>\<emph\>Snap to Object Border\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/13160000.xhp\" name=\"Snap to Object Border\"\>\<emph\>Snap to Object Border\</emph\>\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Snap to Object Border\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> icon in the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> bar.				20200411 15:09:53
