helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149483				0	ast	\<variable id=\"opunktetext\"\>This only applies if the cursor or a contour line of the graphics object is in the snap range.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
