helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id0125201009445727				0	ast	The "Default" entry selects the language of the user interface for the operating system. If this language is not available in the %PRODUCTNAME installation, the language of the %PRODUCTNAME installation is the default language.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154751				0	ast	Locale setting				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_LISTBOX_OFA_TP_LANGUAGES_LB_LOCALESETTING\"\>Specifies the locale setting of the country setting. This influences settings for numbering, currency and units of measure.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id0125201009445950				0	ast	The "Default" entry selects the locale setting that is selected for the operating system.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	ast	A change in this field is immediately applicable. However, some formats that were formatted by default change only if the document is newly loaded.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DE				0	ast	Decimal separator key - Same as locale setting				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E2				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies to use the decimal separator key that is set in your system when you press the respective key on the number pad.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F1				0	ast	If this checkbox is activated, the character shown after "Same as locale setting" is inserted when you press the key on the number pad. If this checkbox is not activated, the character that your keyboard driver software provides is inserted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147209				0	ast	Default currency				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145120				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_LISTBOX_OFA_TP_LANGUAGES_LB_CURRENCY\"\>Specifies the default currency that is used for the currency format and the currency fields.\</ahelp\> If you change the locale setting, the default currency changes automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148491				0	ast	The default entry applies to the currency format that is assigned to the selected locale setting.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	ast	A change in \<emph\>Default currency\</emph\> field will be transmitted to all open documents and will lead to corresponding changes in the dialogs and icons that control the currency format in these documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153127				0	ast	Default languages for documents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763				0	ast	Specifies the languages for spellchecking, thesaurus and hyphenation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663	8			0	ast	The spellcheck for the selected language only functions when you have installed the corresponding language module. \<embedvar href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010401.xhp#sprachenfeld\"/\>         				20200411 15:09:53
