helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_LISTBOX_OFA_TP_LANGUAGES_LB_WEST_LANG\"\>Specifies the language used for the spellcheck function in western alphabets.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
