helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_LISTBOX_OFA_TP_LANGUAGES_LB_COMPLEX_LANG\"\>Specifies the language for the complex text layout spellcheck.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149807				0	ast	For the current document only				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155432				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR_CHECKBOX_OFA_TP_LANGUAGES_CB_CURRENT_DOC\"\>Specifies that the settings for default languages are valid only for the current document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156441				0	ast	Enhanced language support				20200411 15:09:53
