helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771	2			0	ast	            \<variable id=\"farbentext\"\>                \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Allows you to define your own colors.\</ahelp\>            \</variable\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id9701528				0	ast	%PRODUCTNAME uses only the RGB color model for printing in color. The CMYK controls are provided only to ease the input of color values using CMYK notation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778801				0	ast	Color Field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778801				0	ast	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorField\"\>In the big color field, you click to select a new color.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778802				0	ast	Color Slider				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778802				0	ast	Click any of the six option buttons Red, Green, Blue, Hue, Saturation, or Brightness. The color slider changes to show the available range of values. \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorSlider\"\>In the color slider, you will see the range of values that you can change, depending on the selected option button. Click inside the color slider to change values in the big color field.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778803				0	ast	Current Color Preview				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778803				0	ast	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorPreview\"\>In the left half of the preview field, you will always see the current result of your work in this dialog.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778803b				0	ast	Previous Color				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778803b				0	ast	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorPrevious\"\>In the right half of the preview field, you will see the original color from the parent tab, \<emph\>Colors\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778804				0	ast	RGB				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778804				0	ast	These set of controls allow to choose a color in the RGB color model, where red, green, and blue are combined to produce a color.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778805				0	ast	Red				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778805				0	ast	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:MetricField:ColorPicker:Red\"\>Sets the Red color value in the RGB color model.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778806				0	ast	Green				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778806				0	ast	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:RadioButton:ColorPicker:Green\"\>Sets the Green color value in the RGB color model.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778807				0	ast	Blue				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778807				0	ast	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:MetricField:ColorPicker:Blue\"\>Sets the Blue color value in the RGB color model.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778808				0	ast	Hex				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778808				0	ast	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:MetricField:ColorPicker:Hex\"\>Sets the Red, Green, and Blue color value in the RGB color model, using a hexadecimal format RRGGBB.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778809				0	ast	HSB				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778809				0	ast	These set of controls allow to choose a color in the HSB color space.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778810				0	ast	Hue				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778810				0	ast	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:MetricField:ColorPicker:Hue\"\>Sets the Hue in the HSB color model.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778811				0	ast	Saturation				20200411 15:09:53
