helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149575				0	ast	Several records or removing a selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	ast	Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>and click the row header				20200411 15:09:53
