helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910	64			0	ast	To change the measurement units used in this dialog, choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - General, and then select a new measurement unit in the Settings area. 				20200411 15:09:53
