helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146060				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:HangulHanjaConversion\"\>Converts the selected Korean text from Hangul to Hanja or from Hanja to Hangul.\</ahelp\> The menu command can only be called if you enable Asian language support under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>, and if a text formatted in Korean language is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
