helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01190000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149149	7			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:PUSHBUTTON:DLG_VERSIONS:PB_SAVE\"\>Saves the current state of the document as a new version. If you want, you can also enter comments in the \<emph\>Insert Version Comment \</emph\>dialog before you save the new version.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
