helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020300.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:CHECKBOX:RID_SVXPAGE_NUMBERFORMAT:BTN_NEGRED\"\>Changes the font color of negative numbers to red.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
