helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155391				0	ast	Asian text font - Chinese, Japanese, or Korean character sets				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	ast	Complex text layout font - right-to-left text direction				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153663	58			0	ast	To enable support for complex text layout and Asian character sets, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>, and then select the \<emph\>Enabled \</emph\>box in the corresponding area.				20200411 15:09:53
