helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159256				0	ast	To open more than one document at the same time, each in an own window, hold \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> while you click the files, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	ast	Click a column header to sort the files. Click again to reverse the sort order.				20200411 15:09:53
