helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150278				0	ast	\<variable id=\"anford\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TwainTransfer\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Scans an image, and then inserts the result into the document. The scanning dialog is provided by the manufacturer of the scanner.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> For an explanation of the dialog please refer to the documentation on your scanner.				20200411 15:09:53
