helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3160481				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:EDIT:TP_MANAGE_STYLES:ED_NAME\"\>Displays the name of the selected style. If you are creating or modifying a custom style, enter a name for the style. You cannot change the name of a predefined style.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153750	13			0	ast	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>AutoUpdate \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153749				0	ast	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:CHECKBOX:TP_MANAGE_STYLES:CB_AUTO\"\>Updates the style when you apply direct formatting to a paragraph using this style in your document. The formatting of all paragraphs using this style is automatically updated.\</ahelp\>\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	par_id0107200910584081				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Updates the style when you apply direct formatting to a paragraph using this style in your document. The formatting of all paragraphs using this style is automatically updated.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155392				0	ast	Next Style				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:LISTBOX:TP_MANAGE_STYLES:LB_NEXT\"\>Select an existing style that you want to follow the current style in your document. For paragraph styles, the next style is applied to the paragraph that is created when you press Enter. For page styles, the next style is applied when a new page is created.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
