helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01160200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152823				0	ast	\<variable id=\"versendentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SendMail\"\>Opens a new window in your default e-mail program with the current document as an attachment. The current file format is used.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> If the document is new and unsaved, the format specified in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - General is used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01160200.xhp	0	help	par_id0807200809553672				0	ast	If the document is in HTML format, any embedded or linked images will not be sent with the e-mail.				20200411 15:09:53
