helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154321				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GLBLTREE_INS_NEW_FILE\"\>Creates and inserts a new sub-document.\</ahelp\> When you create a new document, you are prompted to enter the file name and the location where you want to save the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154472				0	ast	Text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163712				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GLBLTREE_INS_TEXT\"\>Inserts a new paragraph in the master document where you can enter text. You cannot insert text next to an existing text entry in the Navigator.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154640				0	ast	Save Contents as well				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX21\"\>Saves a copy of the contents of the linked files in the master document. This ensures that the current contents are available when the linked files cannot be accessed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151351				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id3152885\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20248.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152885\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
