helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CB				0	ast	This label of this button changes to \<emph\>Resume\</emph\> if you leave the Spellcheck dialog open when you return to your document. To continue the spellcheck from the current position of the cursor, click \<emph\>Resume\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1024200804091149				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>While performing a grammar check, click Ignore Rule to ignore the rule that is currently flagged as a grammar error.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
