helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05230300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148983				0	ast	Pivot point				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05230300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150902				0	ast	The selected object is rotated around a pivot point that you specify. The default pivot point is at the center of the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05230300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153528				0	ast	If you set a pivot point too far outside of the object boundaries, the object could be rotated off of the page.				20200411 15:09:53
