helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01160300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149999				0	ast	The \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>\<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>\</link\> appears after you create a master document. To edit a sub-document, double-click the name of a sub-document in the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
