helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05210400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149955				0	ast	Lists the available hatching patterns. You can also modify or create your own hatching pattern. To save the list, click the \<emph\>Save Hatches List\</emph\> button. To display a different list, click the \<emph\>Load Hatches List\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
