helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155954				0	ast	Examples				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153792				0	ast	='Ms.'				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150948				0	ast	returns field names with the field content "Ms."				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id315379A				0	ast	<'2001-01-10'				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id315094A				0	ast	returns dates that occurred before January 10, 2001"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150333				0	ast	LIKE 'g?ve'				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147332				0	ast	returns field names with field content such as "give" and "gave".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146062				0	ast	LIKE 'S*'				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155350				0	ast	returns data fields with field contents such as "Sun".				20200411 15:09:53
