helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a new user.\</ahelp\> The \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05000003.xhp\" name=\"Enter Password\"\>Enter Password\</link\> dialog appears.				20200411 15:09:53
