helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154659				0	ast	Si deseya enxertar una fórmula nel documentu de testu y yá conoz los carauteres correutos pue facer lo siguiente:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153818				0	ast	Escriba la fórmula nel testu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153915				0	ast	Seleicione la fórmula				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150213				0	ast	Escueye la orde \<emph\>Enxertar - Oxetu - Fórmula\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154767				0	ast	Enxerción d'una fórmula per aciu d'una ventana				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149875				0	ast	Si deseya usar la interface de $[officename] Math pa editar una fórmula, seleicione la orde \<emph\>Enxertar - Oxetu - Fórmula\</emph\> ensin testu seleicionáu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391				0	ast	El cursor espera na ventana Órdenes pa qu'escriba la fórmula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537				0	ast	You can compose formulas using the Elements window. Open it with the menu \<emph\>View - Elements\</emph\> if it is not already open.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155625				0	ast	If the Elements window is open, use F6 to switch from the Commands window to the Elements window and back.				20200411 15:09:53
