helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154763				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:EDIT:DLG_TITLE:EDT_Y_AXIS\"\>Marking the \<emph\>Y axis\</emph\> option activates the Y axis title. Enter the desired title in the corresponding text field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
