helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	ast	Some of the options are not available for all types of labels. For example, there are different options for 2D and 3D object labels.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150717				0	ast	Please note that problems may arise in displaying labels if the size of your chart is too small. You can avoid this by either enlarging the view or decreasing the font size.				20200411 15:09:53
