helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id130008				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a label for the x-axis (horizontal).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
