helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\smooth_line_properties.xhp	0	help	par_id1068758				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Apply a B-spline model.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
