helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153930				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id3153936\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_circle.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153936\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
