helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AdvancedMode\"\>Modifies the shape, orientation or fill of the selected object(s).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
