helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147536				0	ast	Set in circle (perspective)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CrookRotate\"\>Distorts the selected object by wrapping it around imaginary circles, and then adding perspective. Drag a handle of the selected object to distort it.\</ahelp\> If the selected object is not a polygon or Bézier curve, you are prompted to change the object to a curve before you can distort it.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id3083443\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_crookslant.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3083443\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149454				0	ast	Set in circle (perspective)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151185				0	ast	Set to circle (slant)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150766				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CrookSlant\"\>Distorts the selected object by wrapping it around imaginary circles. Drag a handle of the selected object to distort it.\</ahelp\> If the selected object is not a polygon or Bézier curve, you are prompted to change the object to a curve before you can distort it.				20200411 15:09:53
