helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153415				0	ast	\<variable id=\"vectorize\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/vectorize.xhp\" name=\"Converting Bitmap Images into Vector Graphics\"\>Converting Bitmap Images into Vector Graphics\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3155633				0	ast	A vector graphic can be resized without losing the quality of the graphic. In $[officename] Draw and Impress, you can convert a bitmap image into a vector graphic.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3151241				0	ast	Select the bitmap image that you want to convert.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812				0	ast	Do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118				0	ast	In $[officename] Draw, choose \<emph\>Modify - Convert - To Polygon\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	ast	In $[officename] Impress, right-click the object, and then choose \<emph\>Convert - To Polygon\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3149349				0	ast	Set the conversion options for the image, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. See \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/13050200.xhp\" name=\"Convert to Polygon\"\>\<emph\>Convert to Polygon\</emph\>\</link\> for a description of the conversion options.				20200411 15:09:53
