helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156385				0	ast	To set the default printing options for $[officename] Impress, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - Print\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153914				0	ast	Setting printer options for the current presentation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3149870				0	ast	Click the \<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress\</emph\> or the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab page, and then select the printer options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3150431				0	ast	These settings override the default printer options in \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - Print\</emph\> for the current print job only.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	hd_id4555192				0	ast	Choosing a print layout for handouts				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id7197790				0	ast	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Print\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id1104159				0	ast	On the \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page of the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, select the "Handouts" entry from the Document listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id9354533				0	ast	Select the number of slides to print per page of paper.				20200411 15:09:53
