helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id6744285				0	ast	Click the Handout tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id996734				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Page Number\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Header and Footer\</emph\> dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id6752220				0	ast	Click \<emph\>Notes and Handouts\</emph\> to enter the header and footer text for handouts.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id5703909				0	ast	You see four areas on this dialog with check boxes for Header, Date and time, Footer, and Page number. These four areas correspond to the four areas in the corners of the handout master view.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id4984282				0	ast	Enter text for header, footer, and date. Check the \<emph\>Page number\</emph\> box, if you want to number the handout pages. Ensure the \<emph\>Header\</emph\> check box is enabled if you want your header text to be printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id816064				0	ast	Click \<emph\>Apply to All\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id863063				0	ast	The fields in the handout master view on screen are not updated, but the text that you entered will be printed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	hd_id5036164				0	ast	Printing handouts or notes				20200411 15:09:53
