helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\move_object.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146121				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>objects;moving in slides\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>moving;objects in slides\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
