helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN10675				0	ast	\<emph\>On click\</emph\> - the animation stops at this effect until the next mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\effectoptionstiming.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067C				0	ast	\<emph\>With previous\</emph\> - the animation runs immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
