helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ExpandPage\"\>Creates a new slide from every top-level outline point (text one level below the title text in the outline hierarchy) in the selected slide. The outline text becomes the title of the new slide.\</ahelp\> Outline points below the top level on the original slide are moved up one level on the new slide.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146972	3			0	ast	You can only use the \<emph\>Expand Slide \</emph\>command if your slide layout contains a title object and an outline object.				20200411 15:09:53
