helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146885				0	ast	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + Page Up				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152976				0	ast	Moves one screen to the left.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149013				0	ast	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + Page Down				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150477				0	ast	Moves one screen page to the right.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AFC				0	ast	Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Up				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B00				0	ast	Adds the previous sheet to the current selection of sheets. If all the sheets in a spreadsheet are selected, this shortcut key combination only selects the previous sheet. Makes the previous sheet the current sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B03				0	ast	Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Down				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B07				0	ast	Adds the next sheet to the current selection of sheets. If all the sheets in a spreadsheet are selected, this shortcut key combination only selects the next sheet. Makes the next sheet the current sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145826				0	ast	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + *				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148882				0	ast	where (*) is the multiplication sign on the numeric key pad				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154847				0	ast	Selects the data range that contains the cursor. A range is a contiguous cell range that contains data and is bounded by empty row and columns.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151233				0	ast	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + /				20200411 15:09:53
