helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151112				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>cells; rotating text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>rotating; text in cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text in cells; writing vertically\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151112				0	ast	\<variable id=\"text_rotate\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/text_rotate.xhp\" name=\"Rotating Text\"\>Rotating Text\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	ast	Select the cells whose text you want to rotate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3155133				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Format - Cells\</emph\>. You will see the \<emph\>Format Cells\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	ast	Click the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	ast	In the \<emph\>Text orientation\</emph\> area use the mouse to select in the preview wheel the direction in which the text is to be rotated. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
