helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147336				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>worksheet names\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>changing; sheet names\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sheets; renaming\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147336				0	ast	Rename Sheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150792				0	ast	\<variable id=\"umbenennentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RenameTable\"\>This command opens a dialog where you can assign a different name to the current sheet.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153968				0	ast	Name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_APPEND_NAME\"\>Enter a new name for the sheet here.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153092	5			0	ast	You can also open the\<emph\> Rename Sheet \</emph\>dialog through the context menu by positioning the mouse pointer over a sheet tab at the bottom of the window and \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>clicking while pressing Control\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>clicking the right mouse button\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	ast	Alternatively, click the sheet tab while pressing the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key. Now you can change the name directly. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>\<embedvar href=\"text/shared/00/00000099.xhp#winmanager\"/\>\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Options				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	hd_id2794274				0	ast	Options				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id6776940				0	ast	The Options dialog for the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/solver.xhp\"\>Solver\</link\> is used to set some options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id393993				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select a solver engine. The listbox is disabled if only one solver engine is installed. Solver engines can be installed as extensions.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id5871761				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Configure the current solver.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id6531266				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If the current entry in the Settings listbox allows to edit a value, you can click the Edit button. A dialog opens where you can change the value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id3912778				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter or change the value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id3163853				0	ast	Use the Options dialog to configure the current solver engine.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id121158				0	ast	You can install more solver engines as extensions, if available. Open Tools - Extension Manager and browse to the Extensions web site to search for extensions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id3806878				0	ast	Select the solver engine to use and to configure from the listbox. The listbox is disabled if onle one solver engine is installed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id130619				0	ast	In the Settings box, check all settings that you want to use for the current goal seeking operation. If the current option offers different values, the Edit button is enabled. Click Edit to open a dialog where you can change the value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id9999694				0	ast	Click OK to accept the changes and to go back to the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/solver.xhp\"\>Solver\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_hour.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	HOUR 				20200411 15:09:53
