helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	ast	\<variable id=\"tabellenfuellentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillTable\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies the options for transferring sheets or ranges of a certain sheet.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	ast	In contrast to copying an area to the clipboard, you can filter certain information and calculate values. This command is only visible if you have selected two sheets in the document. To select multiple sheets, click each sheet tab while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\> or Shift.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155131				0	ast	Filling a Sheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	ast	Select the entire sheet by clicking the empty gray box in the upper left of the sheet. You can also select an area of the sheet to be copied.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	ast	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and click the tab of the sheet where you want to insert the contents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147436				0	ast	Select the command \<emph\>Edit - Fill - Sheet\</emph\>. In the dialog which appears, the check box \<emph\>Numbers\</emph\> must be selected (or \<emph\>Paste All\</emph\>) if you want to combine operations with the values. You can also choose the desired operation here.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942				0	ast	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156283				0	ast	This dialog is similar to the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02070000.xhp\" name=\"Paste Contents\"\>Paste Contents\</link\> dialog, where you can find additional tips.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Show				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147264				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets; showing columns\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>showing; columns\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>showing; rows\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05030400.xhp\" name=\"Show\"\>Show\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowColumn\"\>Choose this command to show previously hidden rows or columns.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	ast	To show a column or row, select the range of rows or columns containing the hidden elements, then choose \<emph\>Format - Row - Show\</emph\> or \<emph\>Format - Column - Show\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	ast	To show all hidden cells, first click in the field in the upper left corner. This selects all cells of the table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Hide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147265				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets; hiding functions\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hiding; rows\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hiding; columns\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hiding; sheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sheets;hiding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>columns;hiding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>rows;hiding\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147265				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05030300.xhp\" name=\"Hide\"\>Hide\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156281				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Hide\"\>Hides selected rows, columns or individual sheets.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645	3			0	ast	Select the rows or columns that you want to hide, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Row - Hide \</emph\>or\<emph\> Format - Column - Hide\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427				0	ast	You can hide a sheet by selecting the sheet tab and then choosing \<emph\>Format - Sheet - Hide\</emph\>. Hidden sheets are not printed unless they occur within a \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05080000.xhp\" name=\"print range\"\>print range\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153157				0	ast	A break in the row or column header indicates whether the row or column is hidden.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	ast	To display hidden rows, columns or sheets				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id8337046				0	ast	Select the range that includes the hidden objects. You can also use the box in the corner above row 1 and beside column A. For sheets, this step is not necessary.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id5532090				0	ast	Choose \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05030400.xhp\" name=\"Format - Row/Column - Show\"\>Format - Row/Column - Show\</link\> or \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05050300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Sheet - Show\"\>Format - Sheet - Show\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Up				20200411 15:09:53
