helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3149105				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ISTNV\"\>Returns TRUE if a cell contains the #N/A (value not available) error value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id6018860				0	ast	If an error occurs, the function returns FALSE.				20200411 15:09:53
