helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3145368				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ISTTEXT\"\>Returns TRUE if the cell contents refer to text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id6779686				0	ast	If an error occurs, the function returns FALSE.				20200411 15:09:53
