helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148649				0	ast	ISTEXT(Value)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150417				0	ast	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is a value, number, Boolean value, or an error value to be tested.				20200411 15:09:53
