helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3144756				0	ast	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISTEXT(D9)\</item\> returns TRUE if cell D9 contains the text \<item type=\"input\"\>abcdef\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148416				0	ast	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISTEXT(C3)\</item\> returns FALSE if cell C3 contains the number \<item type=\"input\"\>3\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
