helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154793				0	ast	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISODD_ADD(5)\</item\> returns 1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148688				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>ISNUMBER function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cell contents;numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
