helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3155614				0	ast	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISNUMBER(C3)\</item\> returns TRUE if the cell C3 contains the number \<item type=\"input\"\>4\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154417				0	ast	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISNUMBER(C2)\</item\> returns FALSE if the cell C2 contains the text \<item type=\"input\"\>abcdef\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
