helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153891				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_DISC\"\>Calculates the allowance (discount) of a security as a percentage.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
