helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144903				0	ast	SUMX2MY2(ArrayX; ArrayY)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144916				0	ast	\<emph\>ArrayX\</emph\> represents the first array whose elements are to be squared and added.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144936				0	ast	\<emph\>ArrayY\</emph\> represents the second array whose elements are to be squared and subtracted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D6B				0	ast	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
