helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3152981				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FVERT\"\>Calculates the values of an F distribution.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
