helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowDetail\"\>Shows the details of the grouped row or column that contains the cursor. To show the details of all of the grouped rows or columns, select the outlined table, and then choose this command.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922	3			0	ast	To hide a selected group, choose \<emph\>Data -Outline – \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12080100.xhp\" name=\"Hide Details\"\>\<emph\>Hide Details\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
