helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153152	100			0	ast	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> (optional) specifies the number of characters for the start text. If this parameter is not defined, one character is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
