helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3155327	114			0	ast	            \<emph\>Type\</emph\> is the kind of t-test to perform. Type 1 means paired. Type 2 means two samples, equal variance (homoscedastic). Type 3 means two samples, unequal variance (heteroscedastic).				20200411 15:09:53
