helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153929				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_NAVIPI_DOC\"\>Displays the names of all open documents.\</ahelp\> To switch to another open document in the Navigator, click the document name. The status (active, inactive) of the document is shown in brackets after the name. You can switch the active document in the \<emph\>Window\</emph\> menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Define Label Range				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150791				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>sheets; defining label ranges\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>label ranges in sheets\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150791				0	ast	\<variable id=\"define_label_range\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04070400.xhp\"\>Define Label Range\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	ast	\<variable id=\"beschtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DefineLabelRange\"\>Opens a dialog in which you can define a label range.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	ast	The cell contents of a label range can be used like names in formulas - $[officename] recognizes these names in the same manner that it does the predefined names of the weekdays and months. These names are automatically completed when typed into a formula. In addition, the names defined by label ranges will have priority over names defined by automatically generated ranges.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	ast	You can set label ranges that contain the same labels on different sheets. $[officename] first searches the label ranges of the current sheet and, following a failed search, the ranges of other sheets.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145801				0	ast	Range				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154731				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_COLROWNAMERANGES:ED_AREA\"\>Displays the cell reference of each label range.\</ahelp\> In order to remove a label range from the list box, select it and then click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149121				0	ast	Contains column labels				20200411 15:09:53
