helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153550				0	ast	Reference operators				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id3149024				0	ast	These operators return a cell range of zero, one or more cells.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060199.xhp	0	help	par_id2324900				0	ast	Range has the highest precedence, then intersection, and then finally union.				20200411 15:09:53
