helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	ast	In this section you can select or deselect the available formatting options. If you want to keep any of the settings currently in your spreadsheet, deselect the corresponding option.				20200411 15:09:53
