helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147167	3			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Graphic\"\>If the\<emph\> Graphics On/Off \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Tools\</emph\> bar is activated, no graphics are displayed - only empty frames as placeholders.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
