helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147403	2			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to open the Fields dialog. Click the arrow next to the icon to open a submenu.\</ahelp\>Click to open the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\"\>Fields\</link\> dialog. Click the arrow next to the icon to open a submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154503				0	ast	You can choose from the following functions:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148566				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Other\"\>Other\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
