helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\19030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145241	2			0	ast	Click the arrow next to the icon to open a toolbar with various functions for inserting graphics, tables, documents, and special characters. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\19030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151171				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id3151178\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_grid.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151178\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
