helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\14030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149602				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"FN_FORMULA_CANCEL\"\>Clears the contents of the input line and closes the formula bar.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
