helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147171				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Restart Numbering\"\>Restart Numbering\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145249				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NumberingStart\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Restarts the text numbering.\</ahelp\> This is only visible when the cursor is positioned within numbered or bulleted text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\06140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145082				0	ast	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_numberingstart.png\" id=\"img_id3145089\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145089\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
