helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\03210000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149873				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ChainFrames\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Links the selected frame to the next frame.\</ahelp\> The text automatically flows from one frame to another.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\03210000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145244				0	ast	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_chainframes.png\" id=\"img_id3148771\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148771\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
