helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151392				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTitleField\"\>Inserts the title specified in the document properties as a field.\</ahelp\> This field displays the data entered in the \<emph\>Title\</emph\> field under \<emph\>File - Properties - Description\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148768				0	ast	If you would like to insert a different document property as a field, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The \<emph\>DocInformation\</emph\> category contains all of the fields shown in the document properties.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Date				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151175				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030100.xhp\" name=\"Date\"\>Date\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147511				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertDateField\"\>Inserts the current date as a field.\</ahelp\> The default date format is used, and the date is not automatically updated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312				0	ast	If you would like to define a different date format, or have the date updated automatically, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> to insert a field command and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The format of an existing date field can be modified at any time by choosing \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
