helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154573	5			0	ast	After clicking the \<emph\>Page Preview: Multiple Pages\</emph\> icon, the\<emph\> Multiple pages\</emph\> dialog opens. Use the two spin buttons to set the number of pages to be displayed. 				20200411 15:09:53
