helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148775				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PreviewPrintOptions\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Opens a dialog where settings for the printout of your document can be made.\</ahelp\> The pages are proportionally reduced in size. When printing multiple document pages on one printed page, the whole sheet of paper may not be printed on and a margin may remain.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154567				0	ast	The settings entered on the \<emph\>Print options\</emph\> dialog will only be activated if you print out the document using the \<emph\>Print page view\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
