helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148975				0	ast	Distribution				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153634				0	ast	Determines the number of rows and columns to print, as well as the print size. You can also choose to print several document pages on one printed page.				20200411 15:09:53
