helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155141				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:DLG_PAGEPREVIEW_PRINTOPTIONS:NF_ROWS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Defines the number of rows of pages (horizontally stacked document pages).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145780				0	ast	Columns				20200411 15:09:53
