helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	ast	If the active cell is empty: goes to the beginning of the table. Otherwise: first press goes to beginning of the active cell, second press goes to beginning of the current table, third press goes to beginning of document.				20200411 15:09:53
