helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149504	272			0	ast	If no whole cell is selected, the text from the cursor to the end of the current sentence is deleted. If the cursor is at the end of a cell, and no whole cell is selected, the contents of the next cell are deleted. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id8539384				0	ast	If no whole cell is selected and the cursor is at the end of the table, the following sentence from below the table will be deleted and the remainder of that paragraph will be moved into the last table cell. If an empty line follows the table, the empty line will be deleted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id5891903				0	ast	If one or more cells are selected, the whole rows containing the selection will be deleted. If all rows are selected completely or partially, the entire table will be deleted.				20200411 15:09:53
