helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	ast	On the \<emph\>Page Layout\</emph\> tab page of the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Print\</item\> dialog, you have the option to print multiple pages on one sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3156098				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Page Layout\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
