helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3153388	22			0	ast	To print multiple pages on the same sheet, select the number of pages per sheet and optionally set the order of pages. The small preview shows the arrangement of pages. 				20200411 15:09:53
