helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3156260				0	ast	Moves the cursor to the beginning of the contents in the current cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3145409				0	ast	Moves the cursor to the beginning of the contents of the current cell. Press again to move the cursor to the first cell in the table. Press again to move the cursor to the beginning of the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3154410				0	ast	End				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3153372				0	ast	Moves the cursor to the end of the current line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3154235				0	ast	Moves the cursor to the end of the document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262				0	ast	End				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_nav_keyb.xhp	0	help	par_id3154850				0	ast	In a table				20200411 15:09:53
