helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Inserting Tables				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156377				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>tables; inserting text tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting; tables in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>DDE; inserting tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>OLE objects; inserting tables in\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells;inserting from spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables in spreadsheets;inserting in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets;inserting tables from\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156377				0	ast	\<variable id=\"table_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/table_insert.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Tables\"\>Inserting Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149489				0	ast	There are several ways to create a table in a text document. You can insert a table from a toolbar, through a menu command, or from a spreadsheet. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155908				0	ast	To Insert a Table From the Insert Toolbar				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861				0	ast	Place the cursor in your document where you want to insert the table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147416				0	ast	On the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153398				0	ast	In the table grid, drag to select the numbers of rows and columns that you want, and then release.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	ast	To cancel, drag to the other side until \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\> appears in the preview area of the grid.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153135				0	ast	To Insert a Table With a Menu Command				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149642				0	ast	Place the cursor in your document where you want to insert the table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149609	37			0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Table - Insert - Table\</emph\>. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149858				0	ast	In the \<emph\>Size\</emph\> area, enter the number of rows and columns.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145097				0	ast	Select the options that you want, click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149572				0	ast	To Insert a Table From a Calc Spreadsheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149594				0	ast	Open the $[officename] Calc spreadsheet containing the cell range that you want to insert.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3156250				0	ast	In the spreadsheet, drag to select the cells.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Copy\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154420				0	ast	In your text document, do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153383				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\>. The cell range is pasted as an OLE object. To edit the contents of the cells, double-click the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste Special\</emph\>, and choose from the following options:				20200411 15:09:53
