helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155911				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>text; rotating\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>rotating;text\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155911				0	ast	\<variable id=\"text_rotate\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_rotate.xhp\" name=\"Rotating Text\"\>Rotating Text\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3147410				0	ast	You can only rotate text that is contained in a drawing object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3153130				0	ast	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Toolbars- Drawing\</item\> to open the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Drawing\</item\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3149866	68			0	ast	Select the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01140000.xhp\" name=\"Text\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text\</item\>\</link\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3149600\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_texttoolbox.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149600\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3149590				0	ast	Drag in your document to draw the text object, and then type your text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154415	71			0	ast	Click outside of the object, then click the text you entered. Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/05090000.xhp\" name=\"Object Rotation Mode\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Rotate\</item\>\</link\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3145405\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectrotatemode.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3145405\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Drawing Object Properties\</item\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154252				0	ast	Drag one of the corner handles of the text object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3154844				0	ast	You can also right-click the text object, choose \<emph\>Position and Size\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Rotation\</emph\> tab, and then enter a rotation angle or a new position for the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3155888				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01140000.xhp\" name=\"Show Draw Functions\"\>Show Draw Functions\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
