helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	hd_id3291116				0	ast	To Add Bullets				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	ast	Select the paragraph(s) that you want to add bullets to.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3149635	16			0	ast	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> Bar, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Bullets On/Off\</item\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3156108\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_defaultbullet.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156108\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3145403				0	ast	To remove bullets, select the bulleted paragraphs, and then click the \<emph\>Bullets On/Off\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> Bar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154403				0	ast	To Format Bullets				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3154416				0	ast	To change the formatting of a bulleted list, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3153390				0	ast	For example, to change the bulleting symbol, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Options\</item\> tab, click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) next to \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Character\</item\>, and then select a special character. You can also click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Graphics\</item\> tab, and then click a symbol style in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Selection\</item\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
