helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918				0	ast	You can delete a table from your document, or delete the contents of the table.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155863				0	ast	To delete a whole table, click in the table, and then choose \<emph\>Table - Delete - Table\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
