helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	ast	Type the text that you want to assign numbering to, for example, "Quotation Number ".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155048				0	ast	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Variables\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
