helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3149696				0	ast	Select the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3155907				0	ast	Choose \<emph\>Format - Wrap\</emph\>, and then choose the wrapping style that you want to apply.				20200411 15:09:53
