helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3156108				0	ast	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Styles\</item\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3155066				0	ast	Right-click the page style in the list that you want to specify the paper source for, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printer_tray.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	ast	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paper tray\</item\> box, select the paper tray that you want to use.				20200411 15:09:53
