helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147682				0	ast	\<variable id=\"chapter_numbering\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/chapter_numbering.xhp\" name=\"Outline Numbering\"\>Outline Numbering\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155605				0	ast	You can modify the heading hierarchy or assign a level in the hierarchy to a custom paragraph style. You can also add chapter and section numbering to heading paragraph styles. By default, the "Heading 1" paragraph style is at the top of the outline hierarchy.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155626				0	ast	To Add Automatic Numbering to a Heading Style				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	ast	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155891				0	ast	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paragraph Style\</item\> box, select the heading style that you want to add chapter numbers to.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3150513				0	ast	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbers\</item\> box, select the numbering style that you want to use, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN107CE				0	ast	To Remove Automatic Outline Numbering From a Heading Paragraph				20200411 15:09:53
