helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155552				0	ast	To Use a Custom Paragraph Style as a Heading				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155571				0	ast	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147758				0	ast	Select the custom style in the \<emph\>Paragraph Style\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147782	39			0	ast	Click the heading level that you want to assign to the custom paragraph style in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Level\</item\> list. 				20200411 15:09:53
