helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN10751				0	ast	\<variable id=\"word_completion\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/word_completion.xhp\"\>Word Completion for Text Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076F				0	ast	$[officename] collects words that you frequently use in the current session. When you later type the first three letters of a collected word, $[officename] automatically completes the word. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346	91			0	ast	If there is more than one word in the AutoCorrect memory that matches the three letters that you type, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab to cycle through the available words. To cycle in the opposite direction, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Tab. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN1078D				0	ast	 To Accept/Reject a Word Completion				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN10794				0	ast	By default, you accept the word completion by pressing the Enter key. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079B				0	ast	 To reject the word completion, continue typing with any other key. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079E				0	ast	 To Switch off the Word Completion 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A5				0	ast	 Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options - Word Completion\</item\>. 				20200411 15:09:53
