helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060201.xhp	0	help	par_id3146332				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id3146338\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_ellipse.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146338\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
