helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147741				0	ast	Whole words only				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146345				0	ast	Insert				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149845				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_OK\"\>Marks an index entry in your text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
