helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150700				0	ast	Protected				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150110				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:TRISTATEBOX:MD_EDIT_REGION:CB_PROTECT\"\>Prevents the selected section from being edited.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145261				0	ast	With password				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149555				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_INSERT_SECTION_CB_PASSWD\"\>Protects the selected section with a password. The password must have a minimum of 5 characters.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150549				0	ast	...				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147742				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_TP_INSERT_SECTION_PB_PASSWD\"\>Opens a dialog where you can change the current password.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146333				0	ast	Hide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149830				0	ast	Hide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148849				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:TRISTATEBOX:MD_EDIT_REGION:CB_HIDE\"\>Hides and prevents the selected section from being printed.\</ahelp\> The components of a hidden sections appear gray in the Navigator. When you rest your mouse pointer over a hidden component in the Navigator, the Help tip "hidden" is displayed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155074				0	ast	You cannot hide a section if it is the only content on a page, or in a header, footer, footnote, frame, or table cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154323				0	ast	With condition				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154343				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:MD_EDIT_REGION:ED_CONDITION\"\>Enter the condition that must be met to hide the section.\</ahelp\> A condition is a \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"logical expression\"\>logical expression\</link\>, such as "SALUTATION EQ Mr.". For example, if you use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/form_letters_main.xhp\" name=\"mail merge\"\>mail merge\</link\> form letter feature to define a database field called "Salutation" that contains "Mr.", "Ms.", or "Sir or Madam", you can then specify that a section will only be printed if the salutation is "Mr.".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150086				0	ast	Another example would be to create the field variable "x" and set its value to 1. Then specify a condition based on this variable for hiding a section, such as: "x eq 1". If you want to display the section, set the value of the variable "x" to "0".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_idN108DF				0	ast	Properties				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_idN108E3				0	ast	You see this area of the dialog when the current document is an XForms document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_idN108E6				0	ast	Editable in read-only document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020100.xhp	0	help	par_idN108EA				0	ast	Select to allow editing of the section's contents even if the document is opened in read-only mode.				20200411 15:09:53
