helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145784				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_ENV_PRT:FLD_RIGHT\"\>Enter the amount to shift the print area to the right.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
