helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151383				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_ENV_PRT:FLD_DOWN\"\>Enter the amount to shift the print area down.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
