helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_LB_SORTALG\"\>Select numeric when you want to sort numbers by value, such as in 1, 2, 12. Select alphanumeric, when you want to sort the numbers by character code, such as in 1, 12, 2.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
