helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148983	28			0	ast	Restarts the numbering of footnotes at the top of each page. This option is only available if the \<emph\>End of page \</emph\>check box is selected in the \<emph\>Position \</emph\>area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149040				0	ast	Per chapter				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152766				0	ast	Restarts the numbering of footnotes at the beginning of each chapter.				20200411 15:09:53
