helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147742				0	ast	Character Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146335				0	ast	You can assign styles to footnote anchors and text. You can use the predefined footnote styles, or use a different style.				20200411 15:09:53
