helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055A				0	ast	Add				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_seladdlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055E				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the database file that contains the addresses that you want to use as an address list.\</ahelp\> If the file contains more than one table, the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mm_seltab.xhp\"\>Select Table\</link\> dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
