helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148968				0	ast	No numbering symbol. Only the character or symbol defined in the \<emph\>Separator\</emph\> fields appears at the beginning of the numbered line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147098				0	ast	Character Style				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147224				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_OUTLINE_NUM:LB_CHARFMT\"\>Select the format of the numbering character.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153643				0	ast	Show sublevels				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147575				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:TP_OUTLINE_NUM:NF_ALL_LEVEL\"\>Select the number of outline levels to include in the chapter numbering. For example, select "3" to display three levels of chapter numbering: 1.1.1\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152772				0	ast	Separator Before				20200411 15:09:53
