helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154386				0	ast	Separator After				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153358				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_OUTLINE_NUM:ED_SUFFIX\"\>Enter the text that you want to display after the chapter number.\</ahelp\> For example, type a period (.) to display "1."				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150590				0	ast	Start at				20200411 15:09:53
