helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146337				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_FRM_STD:CB_MIRROR\"\>Reverses the current horizontal alignment settings on even pages.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148446				0	ast	You can also use the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060300.xhp\" name=\"Graphics\"\>\<emph\>Graphics\</emph\>\</link\> flip options to adjust the layout of objects on even and odd pages.				20200411 15:09:53
