helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_newaddlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN10542				0	ast	New Address List				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_newaddlis.xhp	0	help	par_idN10546				0	ast	Enter new addresses or edit the addresses for \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge03.xhp\"\>mail merge\</link\> documents. When you click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>, a dialog prompts you for the location to save the address list.				20200411 15:09:53
