helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153925				0	ast	In the \<emph\>Databases in Use\</emph\> list, select the database table that you want to replace.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147169				0	ast	In the \<emph\>Available Databases\</emph\> list, select the replacement database table.				20200411 15:09:53
