helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149493				0	ast	Character Style for main entries				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3149109				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:LB_MAIN_ENTRY_STYLE\"\>Specify the formatting style for the main entries in the alphabetical index. To convert an index entry into a main entry, click in front of the index field in the document and then choose \<emph\>Edit - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120100.xhp\" name=\"Index Entry\"\>\<emph\>Index Entry\</emph\>\</link\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148977				0	ast	Alphabetical delimiter				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3147100				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:CB_ALPHADELIM\"\>Uses the initial letters of the alphabetically arranged index entries as section headings.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226				0	ast	Key separated by commas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120222.xhp	0	help	par_id3153631				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_TOX_ENTRY:CB_COMMASEPARATED\"\>Arranges the index entries on the same line, separated by commas.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Styles in Writer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	bm_id4005249				0	ast	\<bookmark_value\>styles;categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>character styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paragraph styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>frames; styles\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page styles;style categories\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbering;style categories\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150344				0	ast	Styles in Writer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149052				0	ast	The following information concerns Writer styles that you can apply using the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\"\>Styles and Formatting\</link\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150015				0	ast	If you want, you can edit the styles of the current document, and then save the document as a template. To save the document as template, choose \<emph\>File - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110300.xhp\" name=\"Templates - Save\"\>\<emph\>Templates - Save\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150572				0	ast	Style Category				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153721				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2:LISTBOX:RID_STYLECATALOG:BT_TOOL\"\>These are the different categories of formatting styles.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151271				0	ast	Name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153154				0	ast	Description				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151172	6			0	ast	Character Styles 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	ast	Use Character Styles to format single characters, or entire words and phrases. If you want, you can nest Character Styles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150713	8			0	ast	Paragraph Styles 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149810				0	ast	Use Paragraph Styles to format paragraphs, including the font type and size. You can also select the paragraph style to apply to the next paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151308				0	ast	Frame Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147527				0	ast	Use Frame Styles to format text and graphic frames.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	12			0	ast	Page Styles 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155897				0	ast	Use Page Styles to organize the structure of the document, and to add page numbers. You can also specify the page style to apply to the first page that follows after a page break.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154196	63			0	ast	Numbering Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149298	64			0	ast	Use Numbering Styles to format numbered or bulleted lists.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149821				0	ast	Style Groups				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154828				0	ast	These are the style groups that you can display in the Styles and Formatting window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148977				0	ast	Name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149032				0	ast	Meaning				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153642				0	ast	Automatic				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152769				0	ast	Displays styles appropriate to the current context.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154374				0	ast	All Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153351				0	ast	Displays all styles of the active style category.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150590				0	ast	Applied Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168	24			0	ast	Displays the styles (of selected category) applied in the current document. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156368				0	ast	Custom Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145780				0	ast	Displays all user-defined styles in the selected style category.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155908				0	ast	Character Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150114				0	ast	Displays formatting styles for text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150700				0	ast	Chapter Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147412				0	ast	Displays formatting styles for headings.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147500				0	ast	List Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149568				0	ast	Displays formatting styles for numbered or bulleted lists.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145263				0	ast	Index Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155975				0	ast	Displays formatting styles for indexes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149213				0	ast	Special Region Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147736				0	ast	Displays formatting styles for headers, footers, footnotes, endnotes, tables, and captions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146339				0	ast	HTML Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149845				0	ast	Displays a list of styles for HTML documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155560				0	ast	Conditional Styles				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154774				0	ast	Displays the user-defined conditional styles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151090				0	ast	Hierarchical				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148448				0	ast	Displays the styles in the selected category in a hierarchical list. To view the styles in a sublevel, click on the plus sign (+) next to the sublevel name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155580				0	ast	Template Management				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145622				0	ast	Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110100.xhp\" name=\"Template Management\"\>\<emph\>Template Management\</emph\>\</link\> dialog to copy styles from one document to another.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	While  Typing				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147436	1			0	ast	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150100.xhp\" name=\"While  Typing\"\>While Typing\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017	2			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:OnlineAutoFormat\"\>Automatically formats the document while you type. To set the formatting options, choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>\<emph\> Options\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Options \</emph\>tab.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	ast	You can use AutoCorrect to format text documents and plain ASCII text files, but not characters that you have manually formatted. Automatic \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040100.xhp\" name=\"word completion\"\>word completion\</link\> only occurs after you type a word for the second time in a document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147407				0	ast	To reverse the last AutoCorrect action, choose \<emph\>Edit - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/02010000.xhp\" name=\"Undo\"\>\<emph\>Undo\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150536				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150200.xhp\" name=\"Other AutoFormat rules\"\>Other AutoCorrect rules\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge00.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Mail Merge Wizard				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge00.xhp	0	help	par_idN10549				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge00.xhp\"\>Mail Merge Wizard\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge00.xhp	0	help	par_idN10559				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Starts the Mail Merge Wizard to create form letters or send e-mail messages to many recipients.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge00.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CC				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge01.xhp\" name=\"Mail Merge Wizard - Starting document\"\>Mail Merge Wizard - Starting document\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge00.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F6				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/01150000.xhp\"\>Configurable Mail Merge dialog\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	ast	Navigator				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151177				0	ast	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149802				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Navigator\"\>Shows or hides the Navigator, where you can quickly jump to different parts of your document. You can also use the Navigator to insert elements from the current document or other open documents, and to organize master documents.\</ahelp\> To edit an item in the Navigator, right-click the item, and then choose a command from the context menu. If you want, you can \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#andocken\" name=\"dock\"\>dock\</link\> the Navigator at the edge of your workspace.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154475				0	ast	To open the Navigator, choose \<emph\>View - Navigator\</emph\>. To move the Navigator, drag its title bar. To dock the Navigator, drag its title bar to the left or to the right edge of the workspace. To undock the Navigator, double-click in a free area of the Navigator.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149490				0	ast	Click the plus sign (+) next to a category in the Navigator to view the items in the category. To view the number of items in a category, rest your mouse pointer over the category in the Navigator. To jump to an item in the document, double-click the item in the Navigator.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149106				0	ast	To jump to the next or previous item in a document, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>Navigation\</link\> icon to open the Navigation toolbar, click the item category, and then click the up or down arrows.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136				0	ast	A hidden section in a document appears gray in the Navigator, and displays the text "hidden" when you rest the mouse pointer over it. The same applies to header and footer contents of Page Styles that are not used in a document, and hidden contents in tables, text frames, graphics, OLE objects, and indexes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149176				0	ast	Toggle				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155917				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Switches between master view and normal view if a master document is open.\</ahelp\>Switches between \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"master view\"\>master view\</link\> and normal view if a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010001.xhp\" name=\"master document\"\>master document\</link\> is open.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150689				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id3150695\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20244.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150695\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149568				0	ast	Toggle				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145272				0	ast	Navigation				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150558	70			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> toolbar, where you can quickly jump to the next or the previous item in the category that you select. Select the category, and then click the "Previous" and "Next" arrows.\</ahelp\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>Navigation\</link\> toolbar, where you can quickly jump to the next or the previous item in the category that you select. Select the category, and then click the "Previous" and "Next" arrows.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149838				0	ast	To continue the search, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Repeat Search\"\>\<emph\>Repeat Search\</emph\>\</link\> icon on the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1087B				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id3628141\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20249.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3628141\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
