helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150096				0	ast	Previous				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148784				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Jumps to the previous item in the document. To specify the type of item to jump to, click the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> icon, and then click an item category - for example, "Graphics".\</ahelp\>Jumps to the previous item in the document. To specify the type of item to jump to, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>Navigation\</link\> icon, and then click an item category - for example, "Graphics".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154616				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id3154622\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20186.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154622\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
