helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155548				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX16\"\>Type the number of the page number that you want to jump to, and then press Enter.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148933	74			0	ast	To quickly move the cursor to another page while you are in a document, press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F5, type the number of the page that you want to jump to, and then wait a few moments.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155308				0	ast	List Box				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155325	8			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX7\"\>Shows or hides the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
