helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153670	17			0	ast	\<variable id=\"bearbeitenautomatisch\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SW:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_INS_FOOTNOTE:RB_NUMBER_AUTO\"\>Automatically assigns consecutive numbers to the footnotes or endnotes that you insert.\</ahelp\> To change the settings for automatic numbering, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Footnotes\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Footnotes/Endnotes\</emph\>\</link\>. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152952				0	ast	Character				20200411 15:09:53
