helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149493				0	ast	Type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151256				0	ast	Select whether to insert a footnote or an endnote. Endnote numbering is separate from the footnote numbering.				20200411 15:09:53
