helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153672	5			0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_FLD_DOK:LB_DOKTYPE\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the \<emph\>Select \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> The following fields are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3155182				0	ast	Type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3143272				0	ast	Meaning				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151248				0	ast	Author				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148975	11			0	ast	Inserts the name of the current user. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145759				0	ast	Chapter				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149172				0	ast	Inserts the chapter number and/or the chapter name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145771				0	ast	Date				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370				0	ast	Inserts the current date. You can insert the date as a fixed field - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Date (fixed)\</item\> - that does not change, or as a dynamic field - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Date\</item\> - that it is updated automatically. To manually update the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Date\</item\> field, press F9.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150699				0	ast	File name				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150122				0	ast	Inserts the filename and/or the directory path of the current document, as well as the filename without extension.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3147495				0	ast	Page				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145264				0	ast	Inserts the page number of the current, previous, or next page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150561				0	ast	Sender				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146341				0	ast	Inserts fields containing user data. You can change the user-data that is displayed by choosing \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010100.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - User Data\"\>$[officename] - User Data\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3148863				0	ast	Statistics				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3151091	23			0	ast	Inserts document statistics, such as page and word counts, as a field. To view the statistics of a document, choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Statistics\</emph\> tab.               				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3153302				0	ast	Templates				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3156123				0	ast	Inserts the filename, the path, or the filename without the file extension of the current template. You can also insert the names of the "Category" and the "Style" formats used in the current template. To view the names of the template categories and the styles used in the templates, choose \<emph\>File - Templates -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110100.xhp\" name=\"Organize\"\>\<emph\>Organize\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146939				0	ast	Time				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154340				0	ast	Inserts the current time. You can insert the time as a fixed field - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Time (fixed)\</item\> - that does not change, or as a dynamic field - \<item type=\"literal\"\>Time\</item\> - that it is updated automatically. To manually update the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Time\</item\> field, press F9.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154631	26			0	ast	The following fields can only be inserted if the corresponding field type is selected in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				20200411 15:09:53
