helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:TP_ENDNOTEOPTION:FLD_OFFSET\"\>Enter the number for the first endnote in the document.\</ahelp\> This is useful if want the endnote numbering to span more than one document.				20200411 15:09:53
