helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152943				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_ENDNOTEOPTION:ED_PREFIX\"\>Enter the text that you want to display in front of the endnote number in the note text.\</ahelp\> For example, type "re: " to display "re: 1".				20200411 15:09:53
