helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_cusgrelin.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055C				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Adds the selected field from the list of salutation elements to the other list. You can add a field more than once.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
