helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_cusgrelin.xhp	0	help	par_idN10571				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select a value from the list for the salutation and the punctuation mark fields.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
