helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_cusgrelin.xhp	0	help	par_idN10578				0	ast	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays a preview of the first database record with the current salutation layout.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
