helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155341				0	ast	\<image id=\"img_id3155348\" src=\"res/helpimg/sc10618.png\" width=\"0.583in\" height=\"0.333in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155348\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
